The programs of UME Editor (`ume` and `ume-script`) contain software of other authors. Their
licenses ask that a copy of their copyright notices and license texts goes with the programs.
This file is that copy. It has these parts:

  1. Sakura Editor, whose behavior UME Editor reproduces and from whose source some files are ported.
